{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/extras/c361544fc22e18fd2ad1e92436b68415.poster.avif?t=1768985708\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/extras/c361544fc22e18fd2ad1e92436b68415.webm?t=1768985708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/extras/c361544fc22e18fd2ad1e92436b68415.mp4?t=1768985708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2>Shizuku and Akane...two pilots bound by rivalry and friendship battle to save their world from malevolent cosmic forces! Revolgear Zero is a <strong>deeply satisfying, local co-op enabled fast paced arcade style Shmup</strong> with tons of customization options and replay-ability!<br><br>Multi-directional boomerang style melee attacks, flamethrowers, burst lasers...a plethora of different weapons are at your disposal to combine and match as you customize your ship, battle waves of enemies and bosses though a variety of game modes including <strong>Local Co-Op Duo Play Mode </strong>and Boost Mode which allow you to alter game rules, engage in cooperative play or take on high-score challenges!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><strong>Ribor....A remote planet situated at the edge of the universe...</strong><br><br>From it, the pinnacle of human combat strength was created. They called it the <strong>\u201cRevolgear\u201d, a highly advanced space fighter piloted only by the best of the best.</strong><br><br>When a malevolent force known as Xeno, thought to originate from beyond a black hole, threatens their home planet, two revolgear pilots and unlikely partners, Shizuka and Akane, are brought together to stop it! As their rivalry turns to friendship through a psychic bond forged in their respective ships, the Pheasant and the Dove, they also uncover personal truths about themselves...<br><br><strong>Where will their paths lead them in this universe torn by war...?</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/extras/f89d0ab27b48a4d067826594c24e37da.avif?t=1768985708\" width=82 height=82 /></span><br><br><strong>Shizuku, the genetically engineered super pilot with a fleeting lifespan.</strong> Her favorite food is hamburgers and her hobby is playing video games.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/extras/5d287ad6fa87e48758e7d4733492a031.avif?t=1768985708\" width=82 height=82 /></span><br><br><strong>Akane, the driven ace pilot from an elite military family.</strong> She has a sweet tooth and enjoys performing magic tricks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/extras/373db502ec5a85401ed617b2f169dae7.poster.avif?t=1768985708\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/extras/373db502ec5a85401ed617b2f169dae7.webm?t=1768985708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/extras/373db502ec5a85401ed617b2f169dae7.mp4?t=1768985708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Control the super advanced Revolgear space fighters Pheasant or Dove, and use your <strong>precise movement skills, strategic weapon usage and combat prowess to earn extra lives and maximize your score!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/extras/f3219fb72ef434905da3ce6ee3545de3.poster.avif?t=1768985708\" width=780 height=440 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/extras/f3219fb72ef434905da3ce6ee3545de3.webm?t=1768985708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/extras/f3219fb72ef434905da3ce6ee3545de3.mp4?t=1768985708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Use the Bit Shoot attack for a boomerang style melee attack, the burst system for a powerful energy beam attack and <strong>tons and tons of other different weapons and load-outs you unlock as you play!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Seven stages with 4 difficulty levels to choose from. <br></li><li>Two main game modes that include 6 different possible endings.<br></li><li>Over 2,000 different equipment combinations. Builds can be customized to suit each player preferences.<br></li><li>Mission mode with 30 different challenges that test your skills with various weapons and techniques.<br></li><li>Unlock shop where you can obtain custom weapons and gear using in-game currency.<br></li><li>Diverse Stage Designs: From menacing mechs to mystical dragons, anything goes!<br></li><li>Two Main Characters with Voice Acting. Enjoy various dialogues that change from situation to situation.<br></li><li>Playable with game-pad of course, and with keyboard and mouse as well.<br></li><li>Local Co-Op! Co-op with Algorithmic AI partner available in certain game modes too. <br></li><li>Includes the bizarre mystery bonus game &quot;God of Cats&quot;!<br></li><li>In-game Achievements.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941820?t=1768985708","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3941820?t=1768985708","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/b617eff861