th various weapons and techniques.<br></li><li>Unlock shop where you can obtain custom weapons and gear using in-game currency.<br></li><li>Diverse Stage Designs: From menacing mechs to mystical dragons, anything goes!<br></li><li>Two Main Characters with Voice Acting. Enjoy various dialogues that change from situation to situation.<br></li><li>Playable with game-pad of course, and with keyboard and mouse as well.<br></li><li>Local Co-Op! Co-op with Algorithmic AI partner available in certain game modes too. <br></li><li>Includes the bizarre mystery bonus game &quot;God of Cats&quot;!<br></li><li>In-game Achievements.</li></ul>","developers":["Bikkuri Software"],"dlc":[4282460],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3941820/ac9506079322911909ea31da46e72874aad0a295/header.jpg?t=1768985708","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941820/2000067058/ff55a48d742230e343f08926efccaad16d235d5e/1758961386/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760090527","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941820/2000067058/ff55a48d742230e343f08926efccaad16d235d5e/1758961386/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760090527","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3941820/2000067058/ff55a48d742230e343f08926efccaad16d235d5e/1758961386/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760090527","id":257207309,"name":"Revolgear Zero PV","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257207309/c6cde087985af530ab28086a8841ab288e26efa7